Tournament layer-extension flow scout (codex-2026-06-26-S215)

LAYER SHEET COMPRESSION
Line sheet between layer sizes k and k+1 uses e_ij=x_i XOR y_j.
Every 2x2 rectangle has parity zero; equivalently the sheet has boundary-potential rank.
